I was looking over our high score list, and was curious how it compares to 
the rest of you hack gods.  Especially, I was curious about the following 
things:

1  High score.  Our high score was registered in version 3.0i, patch level 9.

2  Max. hit points.  Has anyone gotten more than 10,377?

2.a  Damage.  Has anyone incurred more than 6,107 points and survived? 

3  Lowest high score.  Our 100th score is 108,406.

4  Number of ascensions.  We have 42 ascensions.

5  Lowest score on ascension.  Zaphod had only 653,584.

6  Lowest total hit points on ascension.  Dicade won with 84 hp.

7  We have an ascension in every character class.

8  Has anyone else escaped, max level 51?

It should be noted that most of the names are not our own login id's
but have been changed to protect the guilty.

I was also curious about a few things.  First, let me lay down the appropriate
homage to the dev team, but was it really necessary to make it impossible
to get an armor class lower than -128?  And why is it possible to get an
armor class of 127?  Did you really think that anyone would try?  I was a 
little surprised when my ac, instead of going down a point, went up 255 points. 

I was also curious whether or not there is a maximum possible score.  It would
be very disconcerting for some hack gnome to discover, after days of dilithium
mining, to find that his score had wrapped around, and was negative a billion.

